            "content": "<h4><strong>The Eucalyptus Tree in Australia</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>Importance</strong></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;it provides <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_31\">______</span> and food for a wide range of species</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;its leaves provide <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_32\">______</span> which is used to make a disinfectant</p>\n<p><strong>Reasons for present decline in number</strong></p>\n<p><strong>A) Diseases</strong></p>\n<p>(i)&nbsp;&nbsp; &lsquo;Mundulla Yellows&rsquo;</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Cause&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; lime used for making <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_33\">______</span> was absorbed</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&ndash; trees were unable to take in necessary iron through their roots</p>\n<p>(ii)&nbsp;&nbsp; &lsquo;Bell-miner Associated Die-back&rsquo;</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;Cause&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_34\">______</span> feed on eucalyptus leaves</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &ndash; they secrete a substance containing sugar</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &ndash; bell-miner birds are attracted by this and keep away other species</p>\n<p><strong>B) Bushfires</strong></p>\n<p>William Jackson&rsquo;s theory:</p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;high-frequency bushfires have impact on vegetation, resulting in the growth of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_35\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;mid-frequency bushfires result in the growth of eucalyptus forests, because they:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; make more <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_36\">______</span> available to the trees</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; maintain the quality of the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_37\">______</span></p>\n<p>●&nbsp; &nbsp;low-frequency bushfires result in the growth of <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_38\">______</span> rainforest&rsquo;, which is:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&ndash; a <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_39\">______</span> Ecosystem</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ndash; an ideal environment for the <span class=\"gap-placeholder\" data-question-id=\"gf_40\">______</span> of the bell-miner&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
